{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39388","headline":"奉和观察郎中春暮忆花言怀见寄四韵之什 · 韦庄","name":"奉和观察郎中春暮忆花言怀见寄四韵之什","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天畔峨嵋簇簇青，楚云何处隔重扃。\n落花带雪埋芳草，春雨和风湿画屏。\n对酒莫辞冲暮角，望乡谁解倚南亭。\n惟君信我多惆怅，只愿陶陶不愿醒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39388.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39388","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}